Description: UEFI firmware FIT image for SpaceMit K3 (Pico-itx/Com260)
 This package provides the UEFI firmware FIT image built from EDK2 for
 the SpaceMit K3 RISC-V SoC platform (Pico-itx/Com260 board).
 .
 The firmware image (edk2.itb) is installed to /usr/lib/uefi/spacemit/
 and can be flashed to the board to enable UEFI boot.
 .
